10.1080/02671522.2019.1678062,2bc46f9913bebe1f,0,,,Author 2 et al.,2015,full_text,,unverified,unresolved,"{""target_index"": 0, ""field"": ""missing_row"", ""method"": ""obvious"", ""verdict"": ""undeterminable"", ""corrected_value"": null, ""quote"": ""Through replicating results previously found with this cohort at age 11-16 (Author 2 et al., 2015, Author 3 et al., 2016), we have shown that the average level of science capital among young people at age 17/18 has decreased, and that science capital is spread unevenly."", ""location"": ""Independent full primary original-specific Results/Methods/Discussion; original identity proof where named in integration/candidate_0015.parent.json"", ""reason"": ""Complete supplied manuscript explicitly retests prior science-capital patterns at a later age, but anonymises the cited originals as Author2etal2015andAuthor3etal2016and omits concrete reference entries. The empirical relationship is present; actual bibliographic identity and possible equivalence to shippedArcher2015cannot be independently established. Do not adopt rejected expert claim that the anonymous2015entry is necessarily represented. This is an actual anonymized-source identity limit after source acquisition, not a background exclusion or an administrative transport deferral.""}","{""authors"": ""Author 2 et al."", ""year"": ""2015"", ""title"": """", ""doi"": """", ""identified_by"": ""citation"", ""study_numbers"": """", ""replication_study_numbers"": """", ""evidence_quote"": ""Through replicating results previously found with this cohort at age 11-16 (Author 2 et al., 2015, Author 3 et al., 2016), we have shown that the average level of science capital among young people at age 17/18 has decreased, and that science capital is spread unevenly."", ""outcome"": ""successful"", ""outcome_quote"": ""The present paper shows that science capital is patterned in inequitable ways, replicating previous results (from students aged 11-16) among students who are approaching the end of secondary school (aged 17/18)."", ""outcome_quote_section"": ""discussion"", ""outcome_confident"": true, ""outcome_reasoning"": ""The overall conclusion explicitly says the earlier patterns replicated. Age differences in magnitude and new extensions do not override that overall verdict.""}"
