olved question is whether the unnamed undergraduate study (or studies) replicated here is shipped row input_row_index 132, another Peverly et al. paper, or multiple papers, which cannot be settled from the abstract alone without the full text and reference list."", ""request_id"": ""luna_0002_093f9256cef7606a"", ""target_index"": 0, ""verdict"": ""undeterminable""}","{""authors"": """", ""year"": """", ""title"": """", ""doi"": """", ""identified_by"": """", ""study_numbers"": """", ""replication_study_numbers"": """", ""evidence_quote"": ""This study attempted to replicate these findings with two groups of high school students—those with and without the diagnosis of a learning disability (LD)."", ""outcome"": ""cannot_be_determined"", ""outcome_quote"": """", ""outcome_quote_section"": """", ""outcome_computation"": """", ""outcome_computational_quote"": """", ""outcome_robustness"": """", ""outcome_robustness_quote"": """", ""outcome_confident"": false, ""outcome_reasoning"": ""Abstract names no original paper and does not settle agreement across the reported predictors.""}"
